# Automation Log Analyzer using Machine Learning

## Overview
This project automatically analyzes application log files and predicts the root cause of errors using Machine Learning.

## Features
- Parse log files
- Analyze log levels (INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL)
- Predict root cause using a trained ML model
- Generate analysis reports
- Fast and easy to use

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib

## Project Structure

```
AUTOMATION_LOG_PROJECT/
│
├── dataset/
│   └── training.csv
├── logs/
│   └── sample.log
├── analyzer.py
├── parser.py
├── predict.py
├── root_cause.py
├── train_model.py
├── main.py
├── model.pkl
├── vectorizer.pkl
└── README.md
```

## Installation

```bash
pip install pandas scikit-learn joblib
```

## Train the Model

```bash
python train_model.py
```

## Run the Project

```bash
python main.py
```

## Example Output

```
Predicted Root Cause : Database Failure
Confidence : 92%
```

